# Jackpot and Superjackpot for iomoon, at the country default (4, Netherlands, English
# text, F11).  The two awards no other capture in this corpus collects: both are lit only
# while Multiball runs (3.2.1), and the multiball capture presses lanes throughout.
#
# Multiball needs the PinMAME fix that rests a locked ball on C44 (commit dfba2385).  The
# 80188 counts a lock from C46, but the Z80's release keys on C44, so before that fix the
# mode announced and never started -- F22.
#
# THE SHEPHERDING IS THE HARD PART, and it is why this script looks the way it does.  The
# multiball start is a chain of blocking waits (F22), each needing a ball event, and the
# simulator's keys act on ONE ball at a time -- the current one, and only while it is on
# the playfield.  Down steps to the next ball, so every wait below is answered by first
# stepping to the ball that can answer it:
#
#   * after each lock the held ball is no longer on the playfield, so Down moves to the
#     ball the firmware just served, which is then plunged;
#   * sub_DC6AC releases a Jupiter ball with command 0xEE and waits for it to report at a
#     SCOOP -- code 0x21 or 0x22 only, a lane will not do -- re-issuing 0xEE every five
#     seconds for ever otherwise.  Two Downs step to the released ball and LCtrl+H puts it
#     in Tragabolas 1;
#   * sub_DC47E serves with 0xE9 and waits for the reply, so the served ball is plunged;
#   * sub_DB457 and then DB7E5 each wait for one dispatched switch event, which the two
#     Downs and the Y (lane 1) answer;
#   * the SECOND held ball is then released the same way and wants its own scoop report,
#     which is the second LCtrl+H.
#
# Only past all of that does DB822 light LD2 and LR21, and the last four presses collect:
# bull's-eye 2 (RCtrl+B) pays the Jackpot, Ramp 2 (RCtrl+R) pays double it, and the repeat
# of each pays only its own base value, because both are one-shot per Multiball.
#
# Credits come from six coins in this run rather than a pre-seeded store: one coin does
# not buy a credit under country 4's own preset, and a coin pressed during the first
# attract cycle is lost.
#
# Keys: 5 coin, 1 start, Space plunge, Down follow next ball, S lane 4, LCtrl+B bull's-eye
#       1, RCtrl+B bull's-eye 2, J Jupiter, LCtrl+H scoop 1, RCtrl+R ramp 2, Y lane 1.
    40 tap 8 KEYCODE_1
  6641 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6721 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6801 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6881 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  6961 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  7041 tap 10 KEYCODE_5
  7200 mark credit
  7210 tap 10 KEYCODE_1
  7400 mark ball-1-start
  7410 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
  7700 mark orbits-lane4-1
  7710 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  7790 mark orbits-letter-1
  7800 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  7900 mark orbits-lane4-2
  7910 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  7990 mark orbits-letter-2
  8000 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8100 mark orbits-lane4-3
  8110 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  8190 mark orbits-letter-3
  8200 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8300 mark orbits-lane4-4
  8310 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  8390 mark orbits-letter-4
  8400 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8500 mark orbits-lane4-5
  8510 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  8590 mark orbits-letter-5
  8600 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8700 mark orbits-lane4-6
  8710 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
  8790 mark orbits-letter-6
  8800 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
  8900 mark orbits-complete
  9100 mark jupiter-lock-1
  9110 tap 10 KEYCODE_J
  9280 mark replacement-ball-1
  9290 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
  9350 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
  9500 mark jupiter-lock-2-multiball
  9510 tap 10 KEYCODE_J
  9700 mark follow-the-released-ball
  9710 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
  9790 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
  9900 mark scoop-1-takes-the-released-ball
  9910 tap 10 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_H
 10050 mark plunge-the-served-ball
 10060 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
 10150 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
 10220 tap 10 KEYCODE_DOWN
 10300 mark multiball-running
 10310 tap 10 KEYCODE_Y
 10500 mark scoop-1-takes-the-second-released-ball
 10510 tap 10 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_H
 10700 tap 40 KEYCODE_SPACE
 10900 mark jackpot-1
 10910 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
 11200 mark superjackpot-1
 11210 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_R
 11500 mark jackpot-2
 11510 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
 11800 mark superjackpot-2
 11810 tap 10 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_R
 12100 mark end
